## ▶️ Run Karne ka Tarika

```bash
# Terminal 1 — Backend
cd server && node index.js
# → http://localhost:3000

# Terminal 2 — Frontend
npm run dev
# → https://localhost:5173
```

> Certificate warning aaye toh "Advanced → Proceed" karo — normal hai.

