## 📜 Audit History — June 2026 (48 Fixes)

### 🔴 Critical (C-01 to C-10)

| ID | Issue | Fix |
|----|-------|-----|
| C-01 | SQL injection — client bulk upload | ORM `bulkCreate` + column whitelist |
| C-02 | `/api/clear-data` — no RBAC | SUPER_ADMIN guard + SHA-256 token |
| C-03 | `Loan.balance` — not updated in payroll | Atomic DB update in same transaction |
| C-04 | Per-employee error aborted entire run | Non-fatal try/catch per employee |
| C-05 | cronManager hardcoded `companyId: 'c1'` | Iterates all active companies |
| C-06 | Duplicate report execution | Scheduler updates `nextRun` only |
| C-07 | `companyId` missing on report models | Field added, queries tenant-scoped |
| C-08 | Dynamic import in async `requestLoan()` | Static top-level import |
| C-09/10 | `updateScheduledReport` stubs | PATCH endpoints implemented |

### 🟠 High (H-01 to H-13)

| ID | Issue | Fix |
|----|-------|-----|
| H-01 | Hardcoded JWT secrets | Ephemeral in dev; exits in prod if missing |
| H-02 | `/verify-location` — public | Uses `req.companyId` from JWT |
| H-03 | Duplicate unprotected audit-logs route | Removed |
| H-04 | Payroll config hardcoded | Per-company `SystemSetting` |
| H-05 | Notifications 200 on SMTP off | Returns 503 |
| H-06 | ESS loan limit not enforced | 422 on `amount > loanLimit` |
| H-07 | ESS `/me` full record returned | Safe fields only — no salary/bank |
| H-08 | Active visit — missing `companyId` | Tenant-scoped |
| H-09 | IPRestriction not tenant-scoped | `companyId` added |
| H-10 | Loan workflow roles unvalidated | VALID_ROLES filter |
| H-11 | System keys — no RBAC | `requireRole(['SUPER_ADMIN','ACCOUNT_ADMIN'])` |
| H-12 | Document download path traversal | Filename from DB only |
| H-13 | S3 uploads public-read | Private ACL + signed URL |

### 🟡 Medium (M-01 to M-15)

| ID | Fix |
|----|-----|
| M-02 | TDS Old Regime + 80C/80D — `taxRegime` on Employee |
| M-03 | 7 attendance queries → single GROUP BY |
| M-04 | LRU cache max 100 + TTL |
| M-05 | FnF rejects `separationDate < joiningDate` |
| M-06 | Offline queue max 3 retries + dead-letter |
| M-07 | Payroll silent error → reverts + notification |
| M-08 | Audit log failures → localStorage queue |
| M-09 | Auth header fail → `sm:auth:corrupted` event |
| M-10 | Financial field strip → 403 with field list |
| M-11 | WhatsApp token → `tokenIsSet` boolean only |
| M-13 | Scheduler `writeFileSync` → try/catch |
| M-14 | Production `itemId` + rate snapshot on create |
| M-15 | Leave threshold removed → company workflow |

### 🏛️ Architecture / DB / Security

| ID | Fix |
|----|-----|
| DB-01 | Indexes: Production, Expense, Holiday, AdvanceSalary, UserSession |
| DB-02 | Timestamps on 10 config tables |
| DB-03 | Biometric PK → auto-increment `id` |
| SEC-01 | CORS → explicit `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` |
| SEC-02 | SUPER_ADMIN cross-company → HMAC-SHA256 |
| SEC-03 | `/api/dev/reset-admin` blocked in prod |
| PERF-01 | Async payroll via `payrollWorker.js` |
| STATE-01/02/03 | payrollStore scoped, `__smSettingsStore` removed, post-run invalidation |

