### Entry #058 — 2026-06-11

**User:**
> Point #4 — biometricStore Server Backup shuru karein

**Claude:**
> Audit kiya — `biometricStore.ts` already server-first tha (POST/GET/DELETE all wired).
> Real problem: Backend routes mein PK change ke baad 4 bugs the.
>
> **Root cause:** `Biometric` model PK = auto-increment `id`, but routes `findByPk(employeeId)` use kar rahe the — always NULL return, aur POST hamesha new row INSERT karta tha (update nahi).
>
> **Fixes in `server/routes/admin.js`:**
> 1. `GET /biometrics/:employeeId` — `findByPk` → `findOne({ where: { employeeId } })`
> 2. `POST /biometrics/:employeeId` — broken upsert → `findOne` + `update` if found, `create` if not
> 3. `DELETE .../face` — `findByPk` → `findOne({ where: { employeeId } })`
> 4. `DELETE .../thumb` — `findByPk` → `findOne({ where: { employeeId } })`
> 5. `GET /biometrics/all` — `ORDER BY registeredAt DESC` + deduplication added (old bug se duplicate rows clear)
>
> `biometricStore.ts` mein koi change nahi tha — already correct tha.

**File Modified:** `server/routes/admin.js`

