## Entry #071 — Face Kiosk: Comprehensive Quality Fix (2026-06-11)

**Task:** "Face Kiosk ko proper dekho or Pura sahi karo" — full audit + all remaining bugs fixed.

### Issues Found & Fixed

| # | Issue | Fix |
|---|-------|-----|
| 1 | **TSC forward-reference errors** — `openManualPanel`, `closeManualPanel`, `handleManualLookup`, `handleManualPunch` used `stopAllLoops`, `mode`, `activeEmployees`, `records`, `startLiveLoop` before their declarations (lines 110, 117, 127) | Removed callbacks from early position; re-inserted after `cancelConfirm` where all deps are in scope. **0 FaceKioskPage TSC errors.** |
| 2 | **`closeManualPanel` stale closure** — eslint-disable suppressed missing `startLiveLoop` dep | Removed suppress comment; added `startLiveLoop` to deps array properly |
| 3 | **Live Detect tab** — `onClick={() => setMode('live')}` didn't call `stopAllLoops()` first, leaving in-flight loops running when switching back from Enroll | Changed to `onClick={() => { stopAllLoops(); setMode('live'); }}` |
| 4 | **Non-standard Tailwind `/8` opacity** — `bg-amber-500/8`, `bg-emerald-500/8` (×3), `bg-blue-500/8` not on standard scale | Changed all to `/10` |
| 5 | **Non-standard Tailwind `/15` border opacity** — `border-emerald-500/15`, `border-blue-500/15` | Changed all to `/20` |

**Result:** `npx tsc --noEmit` shows 0 errors for `FaceKioskPage.tsx`. All 15 feature points + this quality pass complete.

